{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper looks up into the sky, at the vast stars. “I see family. The family I knew, and the ones I didn’t. Scattered to the far reaches of the world. I don’t get to see them often, however I know that there there. Always watching each other. Always protecting one another. In each star, I see all the beautiful people that have been given this wide world. When I see them, I don’t feel alone. I see my family waiting for me.” He looks to beashra, “I’m thankful I was brought here. When my parents passed away, I had no ties left to lean on, and so I had to find my own pace to call home. I’m happy to say, that I believe I have found it here.”","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:43:48.618000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742317269421391902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
