{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"More alright than before. But... not good Baeshra think...\" She takes a slow breath. \"Baeshra want be apex predator long time. Much happy come to Row Kanok. New things to hunt. But Baeshra... Baeshra no good hunter in new world. Baeshra get hurt much. Kill little. Die...\" she shudders mentioning the word. \"Baeshra much weak in new world...\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:54:16.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742319901955457074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper nods “coming to this new world is very exciting, however there are many dangerous things here. Being weak isn’t a bad thing though. It teaches you were your flaws are, where you can improve, and where it’s okay to lean on others for support. Honestly if it weren’t for you and many others, I don’t think I would have survived as long as I did.”","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:58:43.338000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742321022149197845","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"Baeshra see wisdom in Shiny Scales words... but Baeshra still feel weak. Today knights go to old Row Kanok. Fight Wind Gos. Baeshra no bite any of them. Batsy kill three much fast. Cato fight three at one time. Baeshra just.. there... other day fight hags? Baeshra just run... then when try fight again no hurt hag much....\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:04:04.168000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742322367807750164","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
